Upstream model license — potion-base-8M
=======================================

This package contains a repacked (int8-quantized) copy of the embedding
weights of:

    Model:    potion-base-8M
    Source:   https://huggingface.co/minishlab/potion-base-8M
    Revision: bf8b056651a2c21b8d2565580b8569da283cab23
    Author:   Minish Lab
    License:  MIT
    Lineage:  distilled from baai/bge-base-en-v1.5 (also MIT)

Provenance of this license text
-------------------------------
At the pinned revision above, the Hugging Face model repository declares
`license: mit` in its model-card metadata but does not itself ship a LICENSE
file. The MIT text reproduced below is therefore taken verbatim from Minish
Lab's model2vec repository (https://github.com/MinishLab/model2vec/blob/main/LICENSE),
the project that produced this model, so that the required copyright notice
and permission notice travel with the weights.

The `tokenizer.json` shipped alongside the weights is copied verbatim from
the same pinned revision and is covered by the same license.

